## Kızıl Ufuk — Player / Combat / Animation / Equipment Director

Exact current-main base: `eb09113ea3ef943025c338d2a47610d34c86f449`.
Branch: `agent/kizil-ufuk-combat-hud-eb09113`.
Current head: `9e39d96786da51691fbd775b99b4fe49430cdc82`.

### Real development
- extends the existing shipped Player vitals HUD; no second combat/player framework;
- adds accessible `Çatışma` status beside health/stamina/poise;
- projects canonical `aapw:player-attack-window` phases as `Hazırlık -> VURUŞ -> Toparlanma` with combo step;
- projects canonical lock-on target id + measured range;
- consumes canonical attack `reachMeters` + `damageScale` and lock-on `distanceMeters` to show **Erişim**, **Güç**, **Seri** and deterministic **MENZİLDE / UZAK** feedback during attacks;
- unlocked attacks now explicitly keep `data-range=unknown`; range comparison is only legal when both attack reach and locked-target distance are finite;
- failed lock-on `no-target` shows bounded `Hedef yok` feedback for 0.9 s, then restores the underlying combat state;
- projects real `PLAYER_DAMAGED` mitigation as bounded quantitative feedback: PARRY shows canonical `blockedAmount`; BLOK shows blocked amount plus post-mitigation `amount` damage;
- keeps `role=status` + `aria-live=polite` and disposes all listeners/timers through the existing HealthBar lifecycle.

### Same-branch browser RCA/fix
Player Gamepad Parity #118 and Player Stamina Sprint Dodge #154 exposed a real HUD runtime bug, not a gamepad or movement bug. The range gate used optional chaining with `!== null`; when no target was locked, `undefined !== null` evaluated true and the next expression dereferenced `this._combatLock.distanceMeters`, producing repeated shipped-page `Cannot read properties of null (reading 'distanceMeters')` errors during ordinary unlocked attacks.

- `9aba428d784cdad311505cdfd885c63be3afb872`: makes range classification finite-value/null-safe and adds canonical quantitative guard/parry feedback.
- `2a4b9a058283e6bf00ecdecb958d5439d7fe4d6a`: locks the null-safe range and mitigation-detail contract statically and rejects the old unsafe optional-chain/null comparison.
- `9e39d96786da51691fbd775b99b4fe49430cdc82`: shipped Chromium proof requires real unlocked KeyE melee to remain `range=unknown`, then validates canonical PARRY and BLOK blocked/applied damage details.

### Exact-main successor
- supersedes closed/unmerged #816 after merged #813 advanced main;
- #813 changes only RPG/interaction scope; no path overlap with this five-file Player slice;
- merge-base remains exact current main and compare is 10 ahead / 0 behind.

### Asset-first / material contract
No new model/material/placement is added. #584 is superseded by merged #590; `MaterialAssignmentCore.js` and `WorldAssetPlacementPipeline.js` remain authoritative. No editor DOM material code is imported.

### Acceptance
- static Player Stamina/Dodge contract covers attack/lock/defense/accessibility, null-safe unknown/in/out-of-range classification, quantitative guard/parry mitigation and failed-target feedback lifecycle;
- shipped Chromium `checkPlayerCombatHudRuntime.mjs` boots real `game3d.html`, presses real KeyE with no lock and requires real `Hafif · VURUŞ`, attack reach/power and `data-range=unknown` with no page error;
- the same shipped page projects 12.345 m and 1.2 m lock telemetry to prove `UZAK` and `MENZİLDE`, validates PARRY blocked amount and BLOK blocked/applied damage, then proves `Hedef yok -> Serbest` bounded reset;
- screenshot/JSON proof and browser/page error=0 remain mandatory;
- Player Gamepad Parity and Player Stamina Sprint Dodge include this HUD slice alongside sprint/dodge/guard/parry/melee/gamepad/lock-on/PWA/perf/browser gates.

### Ownership
No NPC AI, RPG item/quest/settlement semantics, terrain/environment production, material core or world placement production path is modified.

### Scope / quota
Exact base -> head: **5 files, 207 additions + 13 deletions = 220/1000 changed lines**, 10 ahead / 0 behind. No filler.

